Description: Implements factor-augmented regularized latent regression
    (FARLR) for large-scale assessments with high-dimensional, strongly
    dependent background variables. FARLR decomposes covariate variation into
    common latent factors and idiosyncratic components, and uses sparse
    regularization to select relevant covariates. The package provides FARLR
    estimation, debiased estimation, plausible-value generation, and
    PCA-based DIRE comparison methods.
